## 6. Interview (tuỳ chọn)

1. Bạn **type props** cho component dùng chung như thế nào khi vừa cần `TextProps` vừa có variant riêng?
	•	Extend native props (TextProps)
	•	Add custom props (variant)
	•	Use union types for strict control
	•	Optionally map variant → styles internally

2. Theme object **static** vs **Context** — khi nào đủ dùng static, khi nào nâng lên `ThemeProvider`?
	-	Static theme object is enough when:
        •	Theme does not change at runtime
        •	App is small/simple
        •	No need for global re-render
	-	Use Context (ThemeProvider) when:
        •	Theme can change dynamically (light/dark toggle, user preference)
        •	Want global access without prop drilling
        •	Need consistent re-render across the app

